# 📖 Introduction

Aise environment mein jahan multiple Linux servers aur bohot se users hon, systems aksar ek doosre ke saath communicate karte hain.

Examples:

- Administrators remote servers ko manage karte hain.
- Users remote Linux systems ko access karte hain.
- Scripts servers ke darmiyan files transfer karti hain.
- Applications network ke zariye communicate karti hain.
- Support engineers remote machines troubleshoot karte hain.

Ye communication secure honi chahiye.

Linux encrypted remote access provide karne ke liye aam tor par **OpenSSH** aur **SSH Protocol** use karta hai.

---

# 1. OpenSSH Kya Hai?

OpenSSH hai:

> **Free aur Open-Source programs ka ek collection jo computer network par secure aur encrypted communication provide karta hai.**

OpenSSH is protocol ko use karta hai:

```text
SSH Protocol
```

SSH ka matlab hai:

> **Secure Shell**

OpenSSH ye tools provide karta hai:

- Remote Login
- Remote Command Execution
- Secure File Transfer
- Key-Based Authentication
- Secure Tunneling
- Port Forwarding

