# 2. OpenSSH Aur SSH Mein Farq

OpenSSH aur SSH ek doosre se related hain, lekin dono same cheez nahi hain.

| Item | Matlab |
|------|--------|
| SSH | Ek secure network protocol |
| OpenSSH | Programs ka collection jo SSH protocol implement karta hai |

Is liye:

> **SSH protocol hai, jab ke OpenSSH us protocol ko implement karne wala software hai.**

