# 3. Default SSH Port

SSH ka default port hai:

```text
22
```

> **Important Correction:** SSH port `32` use nahi karta. Is ka standard default port `22` hai.

SSH service ka port verify karne ke liye:

```bash
ss -tulpn | grep :22
```

Ya:

```bash
grep -i '^Port' /etc/ssh/sshd_config
```

Agar koi custom port configure nahi kiya gaya to SSH normally port `22` par listen karta hai.

