# 6. SSH Secure Kyun Hai?

SSH network communication ko encryption ke zariye protect karta hai.

Ye protect karta hai:

- Usernames
- Passwords
- Commands
- Session Data
- File Transfers
- Authentication Information

Encryption ke baghair attacker transmitted information read kar sakta hai.

