# 7. SSH Aur Telnet Mein Farq

Telnet insecure samjha jata hai kyun ke woh information aam tor par plain text mein bhejta hai.

| Feature | SSH | Telnet |
|---------|-----|--------|
| Encrypted communication | Haan | Nahi |
| Secure authentication | Haan | Nahi |
| Default port | `22` | `23` |
| Remote administration ke liye recommended | Haan | Nahi |
| Password protection | Encrypted | Plain text |

Remote server access ke liye Telnet ke bajaye SSH use karna chahiye.

