# 32. Important Security Recommendations

SSH security improve karne ke liye:

- Passwords ke bajaye SSH Keys use karein.
- Jab practical ho direct root login disable karein.
- Sirf required users ko allow karein.
- OpenSSH updated rakhein.
- Firewall se access restrict karein.
- Host-Key fingerprints verify karein.
- Authentication logs review karein.
- Weak passwords se bachein.
- SSH ko zarurat ke baghair public internet par expose na karein.
- Zarurat par rate limiting ya Fail2ban use karein.

