# 34. Basic SSH Connection Flow

```text
User SSH Command Chalata Hai
        │
        ▼
Client Port 22 Par Server Se Contact Karta Hai
        │
        ▼
Server Host Key Present Karta Hai
        │
        ▼
Client Server Ki Identity Verify Karta Hai
        │
        ▼
User Authentication
        │
        ├── Password
        │
        └── SSH Key
        │
        ▼
Encrypted Session Establish Hoti Hai
        │
        ▼
User Remote Shell Access Karta Hai
```

